{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 -B - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\nfor f in ['data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P02/approved-plan.json','data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T201419-9b58ed81/P02/approved-plan.json']:\n d=json.loads(Path(f).read_text());print(f, 'keys',list(d))\n plan=d.get('plan',d)\n for s in plan.get('steps',[]):\n  if any(t in s.lower() for t in ['test','check','verif','mandatory']):print(s)\n for x in plan.get('issues',[]):print('issue',x)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T181809-4cb566e0/P02/approved-plan.json keys ['plan', 'review', 'plan_hash']\n1. Establish the input and write boundaries. Read the accepted P01 register, Apple originals, extracted text, manifest and retained SEC submissions index. Recheck hashes and bind each original to its extraction and document identity. Create scripts/apple_case_v1.py and tests/test_accounting_p02.py. Write only case.json and result.md under data/accounting-master/deliverables/P02. Any newly acquired sources go into a new docs/design/cases/apple/p02-v1/ directory. Preserve existing builders, manifests, snapshots, benchmark files and controller files.\n4. Implement context validation and exact reconciliation using Fraction or Decimal, with no binary-float tolerance. Select facts by concept, reporting date/period, entity, perimeter, dimensions, measurement basis and unit. Check annual/comparative/interim balance-sheet identities; annual principal-to-carrying and current/noncurrent debt bridges; interim statement debt against rounded narrative debt; annual and interim product/segment revenue totals separately against statement revenue; annual PP&E gross-to-net; and annual/interim cash-flow opening-plus-movements-to-closing balances. Preserve each operand’s source and explain every permitted context transformation.\n5. Implement rounding-aware comparisons. Retain displayed values and precision separately from inferred intervals. Encode 97,341 − 321 − 358 = 96,662 and 10,912 + 85,750 = 96,662 as displayed annual debt identities, and 10,848 + 83,956 = 94,804 as the interim identity. Verify 94,804 million is compatible with the displayed 94.8 billion under an explicitly recorded rounding model. Distinguish carrying amount, principal, fair value and derivative notional. For rounded aggregates, propagate operand intervals exactly; never conceal mismatches with a broad epsilon.\n8. Generate deterministic case.json containing source bindings, typed observations, all note dispositions, mappings, bridges, external obligations, availability records and unidentified-history records. Provide build and read-only --check CLI modes. result.md must record the pre-run evidence/default audit, actual commands, deterministic check results, changed-file hashes, environment, elapsed time, input/output paths, decision table and separate implementation/accounting/forecast/human-acceptance assessments. Use the reviewed phase packet as plan provenance; report unavailable Git provenance honestly.\ndata/accounting-master/runs/20261002T201419-9b58ed81/P02/approved-plan.json keys ['plan', 'review', 'plan_hash']\n1. Continue from the approved plan and current partial implementation. Create a concise progress.md immediately in the implementation role, recording the verified baseline, defects above and next checks. Capture hashes of affected inputs and protected files. Restrict edits to scripts/apple_case_v1.py, tests/test_accounting_p02.py and P02 case.json, result.md and progress.md; add versioned source files only if necessary. Preserve existing successful extraction and reconciliation behavior.\n2. Repair contract and exhibit support. Select the substantive Section 501 within the retained Exhibit 4.1 indenture, excluding its table of contents, cross-references and prospectus summary; terminate at the substantive Section 502. Keep any useful summary as a separately labelled source. Anchor actual retained contents for the annual securities-description exhibit, or downgrade its status if only index evidence is verified. Recheck that interpretations follow the selected passages, including series-specific qualifications.\n3. Strengthen reusable source relationships. Verify interim note-to-fact membership through actual HTML note boundaries and original fact anchors, retaining extraction-specific offsets; reject an assigned quantity outside its note. Parse the selected issuer statement cells independently by table, label and period, then compare exact scaled values with annual observations. Remove authored numeric literals as the matching oracle. Reject ambiguous rows, wrong columns, context mismatches and unsupported interpretations.\n5. Extend tests with independent evidence. Assert selected PDF rows using fresh pdftotext output and independently specify expected debt, revenue, PP&E and cash-flow arithmetic. Add source-boundary tests distinguishing contract text from summary/index/TOC text and verifying note membership. Add table-column/value mutations, missing/reordered notes, wrong extraction offsets, broken fact/context/unit IDs, entity/currency/date/scale/sign/perimeter mutations, duplicate dimensions and conflicting repeated facts. Test mixed product/geography aggregation, fair-value/notional substitution, restricted-cash perimeter, exact rounding endpoints and incompatible intervals. Ensure each negative test fails for its intended reason, not an unrelated malformed field.\n6. Complete temporal and provenance tests. Test unknown retained-byte availability, proxy evidence excluded before its filing date, multiple retained conflicting versions without automatic supersession, and metadata tampering against unchanged source bytes. Preserve P01's distinct interim extraction identity. Treat selected-table agreement as representation evidence only; do not infer whole-document equivalence or historical byte vintage.\n7. Generate and document the repaired result before the final reserve. Write result.md with the deterministic evidence contract and assumption audit, actual commands/outcomes, changed source/code/test paths and hashes, environment/tool versions, unavailable Git provenance, elapsed time, input/output paths and approved-plan plus recovery-plan provenance. Include a decision table covering primary criteria, vetoes, uncertainties, next actions and nonclaims. Separate specified behavior, implementation, tested invariants, selected accounting identities, unevaluated forecasting and pending human acceptance. Run the listed checks, fix failures, update progress.md, and report exact unfinished work if the budget expires.\nissue result.md is missing although case.json directs readers there for executed-test evidence; the required implementation progress checkpoint is also missing.\nissue external_records labels a prospectus-summary passage as section_501. Its anchor starts at character 42968, before the indenture begins at 97710. The substantive Section 501 exists at 190993; the comment claiming section numbers were omitted is wrong.\nissue The annual.exhibit.4.1.in_pdf obligation claims heading and contents are retained, but its supporting anchor is only the exhibit-index entry on printed page 53.\nissue Interim note-to-quantity links are assigned by observation-ID prefixes. The comment describes a source-containment check that the code does not perform.\nissue Issuer representation checks search for hard-coded label/value pairs and copy the annual observation value into their result without independently parsing and comparing the issuer row's value.\nissue The nine tests omit several approved adversarial checks, including rounding endpoints, conflicting repeated facts, entity/currency/date mutations, mixed revenue partitions and conflicting publication versions. Independent arithmetic coverage is concentrated on debt.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
